{"id": "en_desert_car_p2", "total": 63.03, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Mark stares as his dead phone screen goes dark in the scorching heat.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.56}, {"text": "He keeps his phone safe because he needs it if he gets signal later.", "start": 4.96, "end": 7.58}, {"text": "The severe daytime heat threatens his life as he waits near the rock shade.", "start": 8.1, "end": 11.2}, {"text": "One. Stay with the car because a vehicle is much easier to spot.", "start": 11.499, "end": 15.1}, {"text": "Mark walks to the shade of the large rock during these hottest hours.", "start": 15.88, "end": 18.34}, {"text": "Moving during the day is deadly, so resting in the shade saves energy.", "start": 18.86, "end": 21.88}, {"text": "Two. Drink your water when thirsty because rationing water while overheating does not help.", "start": 22.014, "end": 26.96}, {"text": "Mark drinks his water now to protect his body from dangerous desert heatstroke.", "start": 27.48, "end": 30.819}, {"text": "Three. Signal for help by keeping the car hood raised to stay visible.", "start": 30.819, "end": 34.48}, {"text": "Mark uses a mirror to flash bright sunlight toward the far desert horizon.", "start": 35.28, "end": 38.34}, {"text": "He knows if he must move, he should walk early morning or evening.", "start": 38.88, "end": 41.8}, {"text": "Hours pass, and a rescue vehicle spots the raised hood and mirror signals.", "start": 42.7, "end": 45.9}, {"text": "Mark waves his hands to signal rescuers while staying safely in the shade.", "start": 46.6, "end": 49.36}, {"text": "His calm actions and smart survival plan kept him safe until help arrived.", "start": 49.94, "end": 53.28}, {"text": "Staying near your vehicle in the desert heat will always save your life.", "start": 53.86, "end": 56.6}, {"text": "Never leave your car when lost. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 57.1, "end": 59.88}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.256], ["two.", 0.256, 0.511], ["Mark", 1.04, 1.48], ["star